Conflicts with core/glibc-32. In /etc/prt-get.aliases:
    glibc-perf-32: glibc-32
This satisfies dependencies only; it does not transfer package ownership.

See ../glibc-perf/README for replacement precautions, CPU/fortify settings
and build checks. Keep both ports at the same version.
Uses GCC and BFD, with -m32 -mstackrealign and CPU targets from user flags.
CET is unsupported on i686.
